From: dqx-studio-airgap build <build@localhost>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 22:15:10 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 8/9] Air-gap build: dynamic (browser-held) PAT mode, OBO for
 SQL, per-user access check

DQX_BROWSER_PAT=1: each user's own PAT is sealed (AES-GCM) into an HttpOnly, Secure, SameSite=Strict cookie and used
only for the Jobs API; Studio's tables are read and written with the viewer's OBO token; start-up migrations and the
in-app scheduler are skipped (the DEPLOY notebook migrates; the scheduler is disabled in dynamic PAT mode).
GET /api/v1/access-check lists what the viewer is missing with the exact fix.
